h that <MATH_0022> and <MATH_0023>.\nThen the fully faithfulness of <MATH_0024> guarantees that we can\nfind an isomorphism <MATH_0025>. Some details omitted.", "source_text_hash": "sha256:7fe84cd950cf9618dc35d4662b2d02cd751a106376f1d55cf5f3600cebee0b45", "unit_id": "tag:003O:proof-p003"}
